'''Detransfigured''' '''Seraphine''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Barry Center}}.

== Quest ==
{{See also|Alchemist (Rift)}}
'''Detransfigured Seraphine''' appears in the {{Zone|Barry Center}} after the player resolves all of the protestors' issues. They ask the player to talk to the [[Alchemist (Rift)|Alchemist]], who will give the player an [[Anti-Morph Potion]] after the player gives them the following: 
*{{Motes|10k}}
* {{Item|Plumber's Bucket|amount=1}}
*{{Item|Riftwart Roots|amount=64}}
*{{Item|Larva Silk|amount=8}}
*{{Item|Caducous Extract|amount=4}}
After the player uses an Anti-Morph Potion on '''Detransfigured Seraphine''', she will turn into '''Transfigured Seraphine''', and will allow the player to buy the {{Item|Used Detransfigured Face}} for {{Item|Agaricus Cap Cap|amount=1}} and {{Motes|1.5k}}.

